### Bonus Challenge:

- Also calculate the **average score** of all students for each course
- Show both `total` and `avgScore`

db.students.aggregate([
  {
    $unwind: "$courses"
  },
  {
    $group: {
      _id: "$courses.title",
      total: { $sum: 1 },
      avgScore: { $avg: "$courses.score" }
    }
  },
  {
    $project: {
      _id: 0,
      course: "$_id",
      total: 1,
      avgScore: 1
    }
  }
]);



